The copy vendored here was taken from omen-fan-control (section 1), from its
`main` branch on 2026-09-04, not from a tagged release:
  hp-wmi.c sha256: 2eab833344d4ff7ca52a07d7fc5a6124c2285028ac0cdf7defc772fbad833d62

Pyren does not modify this file in the repository. At install time
